    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="5" relname="concession">Hershey had planned to have all the systems up and running by Spring 1999.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="5" relname="span">However there was hardly any time set aside for the system to be tested.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="2" relname="restatement">The deadlines Hershey had set to implement the ERP system were unrealistic.</segment>
        <group id="4" type="span"/>
        <group id="5" type="span" parent="4" relname="span"/>
